<title>USA: TRO Learning wins U.S. Navy contract.</title>
<headline>TRO Learning wins U.S. Navy contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRO Learning Inc said Thursday it won a contract to install its PLATO academic skills courseware in nine U.S. Navy Academic Skills Learning Centers nationwide.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, TRO will equip, staff and manage the operation of these centers, five of which are in the United States and four at international sites.</p>
<p>TRO said the contract represents several hundred thousand dollars of revenue and follows a two-year pilot program.</p>
<p>TRO develops interactive, self-paced instructional and testing systems.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
